{
  "name": "Unsubscribe Handler — Brevo → Supabase (GDPR)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Flujo: contacto se da de baja → actualizar Supabase + confirmar baja\n**Trigger:** Webhook de Brevo — evento 'unsubscribed'\n\n**Pasos:**\n- 1. Recibe evento unsubscribed de Brevo\n- 2. Actualiza status='unsubscribed' en Supabase — inmediato, sin delay\n- 3. Cancela cualquier secuencia activa en Brevo (in_active_sequence)\n- 4. Registra evento unsubscribed en email_events\n- 5. Opcional: notificar a Cristina/cliente si el volumen de bajas supera el umbral\n\n**Notas:**\n- CRÍTICO: este flujo debe estar activo antes de enviar el primer email.\n- El contacto con status='unsubscribed' NUNCA vuelve a recibir emails de marketing.\n- Para re-suscribirse, el contacto debe pasar por un nuevo doble opt-in.\n- Brevo gestiona automáticamente la supresión en su plataforma. Este flujo actualiza Supabase para mantener la consistencia.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-doc",
      "name": "Documentación",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "brevo-events"
      },
      "id": "brevo-unsubscribe-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook — Brevo unsubscribed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond1",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.event}}",
              "rightValue": "unsubscribed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-unsubscribe-event",
      "name": "Filter — Solo procesar unsubscribed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "contacts",
        "filterType": "string",
        "filterString": "client_id=eq.{{$env.CLIENT_ID}}&email=eq.{{$json.email}}",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "status",
              "fieldValue": "unsubscribed"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "in_active_sequence",
              "fieldValue": null
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "update-contact-unsubscribed",
      "name": "Supabase — Actualizar status=unsubscribed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "tableId": "email_events",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "client_id",
              "fieldValue": "={{$env.CLIENT_ID}}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "email",
              "fieldValue": "={{$json.email}}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "event_type",
              "fieldValue": "unsubscribed"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "log-unsubscribe-event",
      "name": "Supabase — Registrar evento unsubscribed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook — Brevo unsubscribed": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter — Solo procesar unsubscribed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter — Solo procesar unsubscribed": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Supabase — Actualizar status=unsubscribed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Supabase — Actualizar status=unsubscribed": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Supabase — Registrar evento unsubscribed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
